WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.069
Bu darsda tenglamaning o‘ng tomoni noldan farqli bo‘lgan holni ko‘ramiz: masalan,

2
00:00:06.069 --> 00:00:11.239
zanjirga batareya ulangan yoki prujinaga tashqi kuch ta’sir qilmoqda.

3
00:00:11.239 --> 00:00:20.006
Umumiy yechimni ikki qismga ajratamiz va o‘ng tomonga qarab xususiy yechimni deyarli tayyor shablon bo‘yicha topamiz.

4
00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:28.329
Asosiy tuzilma: umumiy yechim teng bir jinsli tenglamaning umumiy yechimi plyus bitta xususiy yechim.

5
00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:34.964
Sababi chiziqlilik: ikki yechimning ayirmasi bir jinsli tenglamani qanoatlantiradi.

6
00:00:34.964 --> 00:00:42.158
Boshlang‘ich shartlar esa doimo to‘liq yig‘indiga qo‘yiladi, faqat bir jinsli qismga emas.

7
00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:50.470
O‘ng tomon kvaziko‘phad bo‘lsa, ya’ni eksponenta, ko‘phad, kosinus va sinusdan tuzilgan bo‘lsa,

8
00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:55.731
unga sigma teng alfa plyus i beta nazorat sonini mos qo‘yamiz.

9
00:00:55.731 --> 00:01:03.623
Agar sigma xarakteristik ildiz bo‘lmasa, xususiy yechim o‘ng tomon bilan bir xil ko‘rinishda.

10
00:01:03.623 --> 00:01:09.988
Agar sigma s karrali ildiz bo‘lsa, shablonni iks daraja s ga ko‘paytiramiz.

11
00:01:09.988 --> 00:01:11.006
Bu rezonans.

12
00:01:11.256 --> 00:01:15.868
Misol: y ikki shtrix plyus y teng to‘rt sinus iks.

13
00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:22.694
Bu ishqalanishsiz prujina, tashqi kuch chastotasi xususiy chastotaga teng.

14
00:01:22.694 --> 00:01:26.108
Xarakteristik ildizlar plyus minus i.

15
00:01:26.108 --> 00:01:31.550
Nazorat soni sigma teng i, u oddiy ildiz, demak s teng bir.

16
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:36.533
Shablon: iks marta qavs ichida A kosinus iks plyus B sinus iks.

17
00:01:36.533 --> 00:01:42.017
E’tibor bering, o‘ng tomonda faqat sinus bo‘lsa ham, kosinus ham olinadi.

18
00:01:42.017 --> 00:01:45.548
Ikki marta differensiallab, tenglamaga qo‘ysak,

19
00:01:45.548 --> 00:01:50.582
chap tomon minus ikki A sinus iks plyus ikki B kosinus iks bo‘ladi.

20
00:01:50.832 --> 00:01:57.463
Koeffitsiyentlarni tenglashtiramiz: minus ikki A teng to‘rt, ikki B teng nol.

21
00:01:57.463 --> 00:02:04.266
Demak A teng minus ikki, B teng nol, xususiy yechim minus ikki iks kosinus iks.

22
00:02:04.266 --> 00:02:11.414
Umumiy yechim: C bir kosinus iks plyus C ikki sinus iks minus ikki iks kosinus iks.

23
00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:16.159
Grafikda xususiy yechim minus ikki iks kosinus iks ko‘rsatilgan.

24
00:02:16.159 --> 00:02:19.671
Uning amplitudasi iks bilan chiziqli o‘sib boradi.

25
00:02:19.671 --> 00:02:26.905
Bu rezonansning ko‘rinishi: kuch har safar to‘g‘ri vaqtda itaradi va tebranish chegarasiz kattalashadi.

26
00:02:26.905 --> 00:02:32.102
Haqiqiy ko‘priklar va mashinalarda shuning uchun so‘ndirgichlar qo‘yiladi.

27
00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:40.873
Endi siz: y ikki shtrix plyus to‘rt y teng kosinus ikki iks uchun xususiy yechimni qaysi ko‘rinishda izlash kerak?

28
00:02:40.873 --> 00:02:45.806
Nazorat sonini toping va u xarakteristik ildiz ekanini tekshiring.

29
00:02:45.806 --> 00:02:48.422
Videoni to‘xtatib, javobni tanlang.
